SUMMARY:Sunday Sounds | Lo Wolf
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of music and art in the Museum. With a soundscape of harp music\, we invite you to experience artwork in the galleries in a more emotional and sensory way. \nABOUT THE MUSICIAN\nCaptivated at an early age by this incredible instrument\, Lo has a unique and improvisational style honed by years of study in the classical and Celtic modes. She brings her singer-songwriter sensibilities to bear and draws on the world around her to create soothing and memorable soundscapes that reflect the beauty she sees. Performances will take place July 5\, 19\, and August 2. \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/sunday-sounds-lo-wolf/2026-07-19/
LOCATION:Asheville Art Museum\, 2 South Pack Square\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ashevilleart.org/wp-content/uploads/Lo-Wolf-Harp-scaled.jpg
GEO:35.5946714;-82.5512827
